# --- ANTLR generated ---
# Patterns rather than a list of paths: the earlier ~65 single entries pointed at the long-removed
# /antlr module and could not cover new names or places -- which is how 15 generated files ended up
# in the repository. These patterns match anywhere in the tree.
*.tokens
*.interp
**/gen/
**/generated-src/
**/generated-resources/
/docs/intern/
